  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Status Indicator",
    "Description",
    "Feedback icon (20px) used as leading element in Alert, Toast, Banner, and form validation messages. Shape conveys status independent of color.",
    "Types",
    "success    Task complete, validation passed. Checkmark in circle.\ndanger     Error, destructive, or blocked. X in circle.\nwarning    Caution — reversible issue. Triangle with exclamation.\ninfo       Informational or neutral callout. i in circle.\nneutral    Idle or unconfigured. Dash in circle.",
    "Sizes",
    "md (20px)    Single size. Pairs with body text and standard feedback components.",
    "Labels & Icons",
    "Shape carries meaning — never communicate status with color alone.\nPair with a visible label for screen reader users.\nUse feedback tokens: color.icon.feedback.{type}.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Use as leading element in Alert, Toast, Banner\nDO   Pair shape with a text label\nDO   Use feedback color tokens (color.icon.feedback.{type})\nDO   Keep at 20px for feedback contexts",
    "DON'T   Replace Badge / Status in dense tables\nDON'T   Convey status with color alone\nDON'T   Scale below 20px — breaks the shape\nDON'T   Substitute emoji or custom icons"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
